# Belt-and-suspenders against Cargo build artefacts leaking into the
# npm tarball. The package.json `files` field is the primary allowlist
# (`native/**` + `native-macros/**`, the synced Rust SDK mirrors); this excludes the heavy `target/`
# trees if a contributor ran `cargo build` before `npm pack` / publish.

native/target/
native-macros/target/
**/target/

# Local rust-analyzer / sccache scratch
.cargo-cache/
.rustc_info.json

# Test scratch
**/*.rs.bk
